    "role": "user",
    "content": "Program: CBTRN02C. Input files and their record layouts:\n\nDALYTRAN: CVTRA06Y DALYTRAN-RECORD (350 bytes)\n  DALYTRAN-ID                  X(16)\n  DALYTRAN-TYPE-CD             X(2)\n  DALYTRAN-CAT-CD              9(4)\n  DALYTRAN-SOURCE              X(10)\n  DALYTRAN-DESC                X(100)\n  DALYTRAN-AMT                 S9(9)V9(2)\n  DALYTRAN-MERCHANT-ID         9(9)\n  DALYTRAN-MERCHANT-NAME       X(50)\n  DALYTRAN-MERCHANT-CITY       X(50)\n  DALYTRAN-MERCHANT-ZIP        X(10)\n  DALYTRAN-CARD-NUM            X(16)\n  DALYTRAN-ORIG-TS             X(26)\n  DALYTRAN-PROC-TS             X(26)\n\nXREF: CVACT03Y CARD-XREF-RECORD (50 bytes)\n  XREF-CARD-NUM                X(16)\n  XREF-CUST-ID                 9(9)\n  XREF-ACCT-ID                 9(11)\n\nACCOUNT: CVACT01Y ACCOUNT-RECORD (300 bytes)\n  ACCT-ID                      9(11)\n  ACCT-ACTIVE-STATUS           X(1)\n  ACCT-CURR-BAL                S9(10)V9(2)\n  ACCT-CREDIT-LIMIT            S9(10)V9(2)\n  ACCT-CASH-CREDIT-LIMIT       S9(10)V9(2)\n  ACCT-OPEN-DATE               X(10)\n  ACCT-EXPIRAION-DATE          X(10)\n  ACCT-REISSUE-DATE            X(10)\n  ACCT-CURR-CYC-CREDIT         S9(10)V9(2)\n  ACCT-CURR-CYC-DEBIT          S9(10)V9(2)\n  ACCT-ADDR-ZIP                X(10)\n  ACCT-GROUP-ID                X(10)\n\nTCATBAL: CVTRA01Y TRAN-CAT-BAL-RECORD (50 bytes)\n  TRANCAT-ACCT-ID              9(11)\n  TRANCAT-TYPE-CD              X(2)\n  TRANCAT-CD                   9(4)\n  TRAN-CAT-BAL                 S9(9)V9(2)\n\nRule to test:\n{\n \"id\": \"BR-CBTRN02C-004\",\n \"title\": \"Reject a transaction that originated after the account expiration date (overrides over-limit)\",\n \"summary\": \"When the account is found, the program compares the account expiration date, as text, with the first 10 characters of the transaction's origination timestamp. If the expiration date is earlier, the transaction fails with reason 103 'TRANSACTION RECEIVED AFTER ACCT EXPIRATION'. This check runs after the credit-limit check whatever that check found, so it overwrites reason 102 when both fail.\",\n \"given\": [\n  {\n   \"text\": \"The account record was found for the cross-referenced account ID.\",\n   \"fields\": [\n    \"ACCOUNT-RECORD\"\n   ],\n   \"literals\": []\n  },\n  {\n   \"text\": \"The account expiration date is a 10-character text field, and the transaction origination timestamp is a 26-character text field.\",\n   \"fields\": [\n    \"ACCT-EXPIRAION-DATE\",\n    \"DALYTRAN-ORIG-TS\"\n   ],\n   \"literals\": []\n  }\n ],\n \"when\": [\n  {\n   \"text\": \"The expiration date is less than the first 10 characters of the origination timestamp. The comparison is character by character, and an equal date passes.\",\n   \"fields\": [\n    \"ACCT-EXPIRAION-DATE\",\n    \"DALYTRAN-ORIG-TS\"\n   ],\n   \"literals\": [\n    \"1:10\"\n   ]\n  }\n ],\n \"then\": [\n  {\n   \"text\": \"The failure reason is set to 103 and the description to 'TRANSACTION RECEIVED AFTER ACCT EXPIRATION'.\",\n   \"fields\": [\n    \"WS-VALIDATION-FAIL-REASON\",\n    \"WS-VALIDATION-FAIL-REASON-DESC\"\n   ],\n   \"literals\": [\n    \"103\",\n    \"TRANSACTION RECEIVED AFTER ACCT EXPIRATION\"\n   ]\n  },\n  {\n   \"text\": \"The expiration check runs after the credit-limit check, whatever that check found. If both fail, reason 103 and its description overwrite reason 102.\",\n   \"fields\": [\n    \"WS-VALIDATION-FAIL-REASON\",\n    \"WS-VALIDATION-FAIL-REASON-DESC\"\n   ],\n   \"literals\": [\n    \"102\",\n    \"103\"\n   ]\n  }\n ]\n}"
   }
